{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization-roi","title":"优化项目的 ROI 估算与优先级排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/performance-economics-global/performance-economics/optimization-roi","wordCount":2256,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"优化项目的-roi-估算与优先级排序\">优化项目的 ROI 估算与优先级排序</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>工程团队讨论优先级时最常发生的失败，不是选错了项目，而是用错了比较方式。&quot;图片压缩&quot;和&quot;把推荐服务改成多活&quot;被放在同一张便签墙的两端，凭感觉投票，而这两个项目的成本差两个数量级、收益周期完全不同、风险性质也不一样。感觉在这种比较里没有支点。</p>\n<p>ROI 估算的作用不是给出一个精确的数字，而是<strong>强迫所有候选项目用同一种语言重述自己</strong>。只有当&quot;图片压缩&quot;和&quot;多活改造&quot;都被写成&quot;投入 X 人周、每年换回 Y（收入或成本节约）、风险 Z&quot;，它们才能被排序。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROI = \\frac{\\Delta V \\times c_{conv}}{C_{build} + C_{run} \\times n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是收益的量（比如每年多出的转化次数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{conv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每次转化的货币价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{build}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一次性建设成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{run}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每期的持续成本（服务器、带宽、人力维护），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是评估期数。</p>\n<p>公式里最容易被漏掉的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{run}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。性能优化项目有一个反直觉的特征：<strong>它常常增加而非减少持续成本</strong>。把静态资源推到边缘是省钱，但把推荐服务做成多活会增加跨区域复制带宽与运维复杂度；预渲染降低首屏延迟，但增加构建时长与存储。不把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{run}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计进去的 ROI 会系统性高估架构类项目。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选优化项池] --&gt; B{收益可量化?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[先做基线测量&lt;br/&gt;或降级为技术债]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{成本含持续项?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[补算运维/带宽/人力]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[计算 ROI 与回收期]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{回收期 &lt; 门槛?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[搁置或改写方案]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I{依赖是否就绪?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[排入依赖链后面的波次]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[进入执行队列]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[候选优化项池] --&gt; B{收益可量化?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[先做基线测量&lt;br/&gt;或降级为技术债]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{成本含持续项?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[补算运维/带宽/人力]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[计算 ROI 与回收期]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{回收期 &lt; 门槛?}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[搁置或改写方案]\n  G --&gt;|是| I{依赖是否就绪?}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[排入依赖链后面的波次]\n  I --&gt;|是| K[进入执行队列]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><p>图中的 I 分支常被忽略：一个 ROI 很高但依赖&quot;必须先有跨区域数据同步能力&quot;的项目，实际排名会被其依赖项压后。排序不能只排&quot;做什么&quot;，还要排&quot;先具备什么&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成本侧-把不可比的东西折算成同一种量\">成本侧：把不可比的东西折算成同一种量</h3><p>成本侧最常见的错误是只算人力工时。真实的建设成本至少有四块：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本类别</th>\n<th>折算方式</th>\n<th>容易漏掉的点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人力</td>\n<td>人周 × 单价</td>\n<td>评审、测试、发布与回滚演练的时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施</td>\n<td>增量月度账单 × 12</td>\n<td>跨区域复制的出网流量费通常最贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机会成本</td>\n<td>被挤占的其他项目收益</td>\n<td>常被记为 0，实际是最大的隐性项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术债利息</td>\n<td>复杂度导致的后续变更减速</td>\n<td>架构类项目尤其明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险成本</td>\n<td>故障概率 × 影响 × 恢复期</td>\n<td>多活改造引入的一致性风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中&quot;基础设施&quot;在跨区域场景里经常是决定性的。跨区域数据复制的出网流量在许多云厂商的定价模型里按 GB 计费且单价远高于入网，一个看似&quot;只是加一个副本&quot;的项目，账单可能从每月几百美元跳到每月上万。做全球部署的成本估算时，出网流量必须单独列一行，而不是折进&quot;云费用&quot;。</p>\n<p>机会成本的处理有个实用办法：不追求精确，只要求一致。给定团队当前的季度容量是 N 人周，任何项目占用的都是 N 中的一部分，所以&quot;机会成本&quot;可以用&quot;该团队被否决的次优项目的 ROI&quot;来近似。这个近似不精确，但它让&quot;我们用这个季度做了 A 而没做 B&quot;这个决策变得可见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收益侧-三种可量化的收益路径\">收益侧：三种可量化的收益路径</h2><p>性能优化的收益很少只有一条路径。把它拆成三类分别估算，能避免&quot;总收益&quot;这类无法验证的笼统说法：</p>\n<p><strong>转化路径</strong>——延迟降低使用户在关键路径上的流失减少，直接体现为转化率或加购率提升。这条路径的量化最直接，也最容易被高估，因为它依赖一条&quot;延迟-转化&quot;的弹性系数，而这个系数的估计方法本身是一门功课，见 <a href=\"speed-revenue-model\">速度到收入的量化模型</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>成本路径</strong>——同样承载量下更少的服务器、更少的带宽、更少的超时重试。这条路径的估算比转化路径简单，因为账单是可读的：优化前后同口径的单请求成本差，乘上请求量即可。</p>\n<p><strong>风险路径</strong>——降低尾部延迟从而减少超时、减少客服工单、降低大促期间的事故概率。这条路径最难量化但价值可能最高，实用的折算方式是看历史事故的代价：过去一年因性能问题导致的宕机小时数，乘上每小时营收损失。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{timeout}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的下降往往被低估。在跨区域链路上，一次调用超时的概率对延迟的敏感度是非线性的：当 P99 延迟接近超时阈值时，超时率会在很窄的延迟区间内从 0.1% 跃升到 5%。这意味着&quot;把 P99 从 900 毫秒压到 700 毫秒&quot;这种听起来收益不大的优化，可能让超时率下降一个数量级，进而减少大量重试放大与用户可见错误。识别这种非线性断点，是性能 ROI 里最值钱的一项技能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排序框架-把收益-成本-风险-依赖放进一张表\">排序框架：把收益、成本、风险、依赖放进一张表</h2><p>一个可用的排序方法需要满足三个条件：能容纳不同量级的项目、能让假设显式、能在信息不足时仍能推进。加权评分法（如 RICE 的 Reach/Impact/Confidence/Effort 结构）满足前两条，第三条需要一个补充规则。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>年收益估算</th>\n<th>建设成本</th>\n<th>年持续成本</th>\n<th>回收期</th>\n<th>置信度</th>\n<th>依赖</th>\n<th>建议波次</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LCP 图预加载 + 格式转换</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>2 人周</td>\n<td>近零</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 月</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首屏 JS 拆包与去阻塞</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>4 人周</td>\n<td>近零</td>\n<td>&lt; 2 月</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘缓存层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>6 人周</td>\n<td>中（边缘请求费）</td>\n<td>3-6 月</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CDN 配置权</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐服务跨区域多活</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>20 人周</td>\n<td>高（复制流量）</td>\n<td>12 月以上</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>数据同步能力</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>排序的胜负往往不在&quot;哪个收益最高&quot;，而在&quot;哪个先做成本最低&quot;。表中前两项被排在第一波次不是因为它们收益最大，而是因为它们的成本近乎一次性、持续成本接近零、置信度高。用低成本高置信度的项目先把信心和基线建立起来，再投入架构类项目，这个顺序本身就是在降低整个组合的风险。</p>\n<p><strong>信息不足时的推进规则</strong>：对&quot;高收益但低置信度&quot;的项目，不直接排期，而是先排一个&quot;调研任务&quot;——用两到四周做可行性验证与基线测量，产出物是修正后的 ROI 估算。这比在评审会上争论&quot;多活到底值不值&quot;高效得多。之所以强调先测量，是因为指标体系如果没有落地到你的真实流量，任何收益估算都建立在别人的数字上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见的-roi-计算错误\">常见的 ROI 计算错误</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误做法</th>\n<th>为什么会发生</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>修正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用行业系数直接乘自家营收</td>\n<td>行业报告提供了现成系数</td>\n<td>收益被高估数倍，项目失败后团队失去信誉</td>\n<td>用自家数据估系数，行业数字只做量级参考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只算建设成本</td>\n<td>记账习惯如此</td>\n<td>架构类项目被系统性高估价值</td>\n<td>强制填写 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{run}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把季节性增长算作优化收益</td>\n<td>优化与大促同期发生</td>\n<td>收益虚高，下次复现失败</td>\n<td>用对照组或断点回归，见第 3 篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略 P99 非线性</td>\n<td>只看均值与中位数</td>\n<td>错过最值钱的尾部优化</td>\n<td>单独评估超时率与重试放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收益用&quot;提升百分比&quot;表述</td>\n<td>便于汇报</td>\n<td>无法与成本比较，无法排序</td>\n<td>一律折算成货币量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一条值得强调：只要收益还停留在&quot;转化率提升 0.3%&quot;这种表述，它就无法与&quot;6 人周&quot;比较。折算成货币不是追求精确，而是为了让两类不可比的东西可以相减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ROI 的作用是让所有候选项目用同一种语言重述自己，而不是给出精确数字。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{run}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是性能项目最常被漏掉的成本项，跨区域项目的出网流量必须单列。</li>\n<li>收益至少拆成转化、成本、风险三条路径分别估算，并特别关注 P99 附近超时率的非线性跃变。</li>\n<li>排序时把低成本高置信度项目排在前，既降低组合风险，也先建立基线。</li>\n<li>高收益低置信度的项目，先排一个调研任务而不是直接排期。</li>\n<li>转化路径的弹性系数不能借用行业数字，估计方法见 <a href=\"speed-revenue-model\">速度到收入的量化模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"优化项目的 ROI 估算与优先级排序","id":"优化项目的-roi-估算与优先级排序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"成本侧：把不可比的东西折算成同一种量","id":"成本侧-把不可比的东西折算成同一种量"},{"level":2,"text":"收益侧：三种可量化的收益路径","id":"收益侧-三种可量化的收益路径"},{"level":2,"text":"排序框架：把收益、成本、风险、依赖放进一张表","id":"排序框架-把收益-成本-风险-依赖放进一张表"},{"level":2,"text":"常见的 ROI 计算错误","id":"常见的-roi-计算错误"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"性能预算怎么定：从业务目标倒推","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/performance-economics-global/performance-economics/performance-budgets"},"next":{"title":"速度到收入的量化模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/performance-economics-global/performance-economics/speed-revenue-model"}}